<title>UK: IFC adds 200 mln rand to 10-year zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>IFC adds 200 mln rand to 10-year zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 700 million rand from 500 million rand, lead manager Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT   *700 MLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    14.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE *28.30     PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORGINALLY LAUNCHED 13.FEB AT 28.00</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF A GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
